{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20348","headline":"献从兄 · 张籍","name":"献从兄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悠悠旱天云，不远如飞尘。\n贤达失其所，沉飘同衆人。\n擢秀登王畿，出爲良使宾。\n名高满朝野，幼贱谁不闻。\n一朝遇谗邪，流窜八九春。\n诏书近迁移，组绶未及身。\n冬井无寒冰，玉润难爲焚。\n虚怀日迢遥，荣辱常保纯。\n我念出游时，勿吟康乐文。\n愿言灵溪期，聊欲相依因。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20348.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20348","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}